  "goodToKnow": "Die Nachbildung is a replica or reproduction: die Nachbildung eines Gemäldes, eine originalgetreue Nachbildung (faithful replica). Fragile sites are often shown as replicas to protect the originals. The Himmelsscheibe von Nebra (Nebra sky disc, around 3,600 years old) is displayed in Halle, while replicas circulate for exhibitions. Nachbilden means to copy. Plural: die Nachbildungen."
